<title>EU: Official Journal contents - OJ L 172 of June 30, 1997.</title>
<headline>Official Journal contents - OJ L 172 of June 30, 1997.</headline>
<text>
<p>*</p>
<p>COUNCIL REGULATION (EC) No 1186/97 of 27 June 1997 amending the Annex to Regulation (EC) No 1255/96 temporarily suspending the autonomous Common Customs Tariff duties on certain industrial and agricultural products END OF DOCUMENT.</p>
</text>
